# Credential notes — kept on disk for reference, never committed.
# ai.md holds a live hcnsec API key; database.md holds the Supabase direct
# connection string including the postgres password. Both were committed in the
# original repo's history, which is why this repo starts from a fresh root
# commit. The values they document belong in .env.local and in the host's
# environment-variable settings, which is where src/lib/config.js reads them.
ai.md
database.md

# Vercel project linkage — machine-local, regenerated by `vercel link`.
.vercel/

# Supabase CLI scratch state — machine-local, regenerated by `supabase link`.
# The migrations in supabase/migrations/ ARE tracked; only this is not.
supabase/.temp/

# src/lib/config.js is COMMITTED and holds no secrets — it reads every key from
# import.meta.env. Ignoring it broke the hosted build, which could not resolve
# "./config.js" from src/lib/ai-runner.js. Keys live in .env.local (ignored
# above) and in the host's environment-variable settings.
